<title>QATAR: SQUASH-QUARTER FINAL RESULTS IN QATAR INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-QUARTER FINAL RESULTS IN QATAR INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the $65,000</p>
<p>Qatar International Squash Tournament on Tuesday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat 7-Simon Parke (England) 12-15</p>
<p>15-9 15-8 15-12</p>
<p>Julien Bonetat (France) beat 8-Mark Chaloner (England) 15-13</p>
<p>15-10 15-4</p>
<p>5-Chris Walker (England) beat 3-Brett Martin (Australia) 15-11</p>
<p>15-13 13-15 15-11</p>
<p>2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat 6-Del Harris (England) 15-14</p>
<p>15-9 13-15 8-15 15-13</p>
</text>
